## Step 1 — Create your GA4 test property

Go to [Google Analytics](https://analytics.google.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com).

In **Admin**, create a property such as:

```text
Trading Guide - Test
```

Then create:

```text
Data collection and modification
→ Data streams
→ Add stream
→ Web
```

Use:

```text
Website URL:
https://tradingonline.vercel.app

Stream name:
Trading Guide - Vercel Test
```

You'll receive something like:

```text
G-ABC123XYZ
```

Keep that Measurement ID.

You do **not** need to add every generated Vercel deployment URL as another stream.

