## Step 2 — Put the test Measurement ID into Vercel

Open [Vercel Dashboard](https://vercel.com/dashboard?utm_source=chatgpt.com) and select your Trading Guide project.

Go to:

```text
Settings
→ Environment Variables
```

Your application already expects:

```text
NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ENABLED
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID
```

For the environment serving this test deployment, configure:

```text
NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ENABLED=true

NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-YOUR_TEST_ID
```

Vercel lets environment variables have different values for Preview and Production. ([Vercel][3])

If `tradingonline.vercel.app` is currently your **Production deployment**, set the test ID under Production **for now**.

Later, when `tradingguide.com.au` becomes production, change Production to:

```text
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-GYDR9G64W4
```

Your real production GA4 property.

